<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK SETS 2-WEEK REV REPO, MAX RATE 25 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK SETS 2-WEEK REV REPO, MAX RATE 25 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Wednesday set a two-week reverse repo tender to drain funds from the market at a maximum rate of 25 percent, a CNB statement said.</p>
<p>The CNB's previous maximum rate in a similar tender last week was 29 percent.</p>
